  "question": {
    "text": "A series <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mi>R</mi></math> circuit connected with an ac source <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>25</mn><mo> </mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>1000</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> has a power factor of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>. If the source of emf is changed to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>20</mn><mo> </mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>)</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>, the new power factor of the circuit will be :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mi>R</mi></math> circuit, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><msqrt><msup><mfenced><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>ω</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ω</mi></math></p><p>Therefore, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mfenced><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>ω</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ω</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></math></p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
}